---
import { withBase } from '../config/site.mjs';
---
<section class="receipt-section wrap" aria-labelledby="receipt-title">
  <div class="section-heading receipt-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A shipping example</p><h2 id="receipt-title">One request<br /><span>through the yard.</span></h2><p>The operator asks to fix a retry path and merge the change. Native tools handle the implementation, with a useful workflow selected when needed. CE owns PR publication, review settlement, and CI. Completion includes the authorized merge and a focused check of the merged result. <a class="text-link" href={withBase('/delivery/model-routing/worked-runs/')}>Explore an allocation example.</a></p></div>
  <div class="terminal" aria-label="Illustrative chat transcript for an agent delivery">
    <div class="terminal-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>railyard / receipt</b></div>
    <div class="terminal-body">
      <p class="speaker">you</p>
      <p><mark>“Ship the retry fix and get it merged.”</mark></p>
      <p class="muted">allocation <span>Astra</span> · effort max</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> implementation and focused checks</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> CE commit/push/PR workflow</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> <a href={withBase('/delivery/gates/#one-review-and-ci-owner')}>CE review and CI settled</a></p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> merge reachable from <code>main</code></p>
      <p class="receipt-result"><span>post-merge proof</span><strong>verified</strong></p>
      <p class="terminal-note">Illustrative transcript. Actual usage is a chat request to your agent, not a shell command.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
